WEBVTT

01:26.530 --> 01:29.789
[Glory]

01:30.560 --> 01:32.960
[Episode 22]

01:35.560 --> 01:36.229
The whereabouts of Madam Yang

01:36.229 --> 01:37.920
was deliberately passed on to me.

01:37.920 --> 01:39.430
Someone in the Rong family wants
to harm you.

01:39.430 --> 01:41.890
You'd better make
preparations in advance.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.840
Mr. Yan is a true gentleman.

01:52.590 --> 01:54.190
He is a perfect match for you.

01:54.890 --> 01:57.220
Bao, I really must leave now.

01:58.000 --> 01:59.950
Please take good care of yourself.

02:02.680 --> 02:03.480
Young Master.

02:04.200 --> 02:05.000
Young Master!

02:05.680 --> 02:06.480
My dear niece,

02:06.560 --> 02:07.890
I will take my leave now.

02:15.630 --> 02:17.290
Don't listen to his nonsense.

02:25.800 --> 02:26.600
I understand.

02:27.490 --> 02:29.290
Mr. Wen speaks his mind frankly.

02:29.310 --> 02:31.560
Lady Shanbao,
please don't take it to heart.

02:31.560 --> 02:34.190
Now that the Wei case is already settled,

02:35.120 --> 02:36.030
Madam Yang...

02:36.710 --> 02:38.970
She says she is done with worldly affairs

02:39.430 --> 02:41.700
and has no attachment
to this world anymore.

02:41.700 --> 02:44.560
In three days, she will take vows
at Jijian Nunnery.

02:46.470 --> 02:47.670
She's becoming a nun?

03:09.150 --> 03:10.590
The Emperor has issued an imperial edict,

03:10.590 --> 03:12.700
appointing you
as the new Prefect of Linji.

03:12.700 --> 03:14.940
So many wealthy families
have hosted banquets,

03:14.940 --> 03:16.340
vying for your presence.

03:16.630 --> 03:17.750
Introduction letters for potential matches

03:17.750 --> 03:18.520
have been flooding in,

03:18.520 --> 03:20.050
piling up at your doorstep.

03:20.120 --> 03:21.079
Women of every grace and charm

03:21.079 --> 03:22.520
are all within your reach.

03:22.520 --> 03:24.320
Why must you suffer here in vain?

03:24.760 --> 03:26.420
You know she will surely come?

03:26.910 --> 03:29.370
Madam Yang will take vows
at Jijian Nunnery.

03:29.710 --> 03:31.430
She will surely come to see Madam Yang.

03:31.430 --> 03:33.030
The Rong family sees you
as a mortal enemy,

03:33.030 --> 03:34.960
desperate to eliminate you at all costs.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.420
Even if she comes, so what?

03:36.430 --> 03:38.190
You really think
she could forgive you?

03:38.190 --> 03:39.870
As the saying goes,
there are plenty of fish...

03:39.870 --> 03:40.520
You only know the saying

03:40.520 --> 03:42.310
that there are plenty of fish in the sea.

03:42.310 --> 03:43.970
Yet you miss the painful truth

03:44.520 --> 03:45.190
that sometimes

03:45.190 --> 03:47.850
you just can't get over the one
that has got away.

03:47.910 --> 03:49.240
As for what's between her and me,

03:49.240 --> 03:50.240
even if I told you, a blockhead like you

03:50.240 --> 03:51.170
wouldn't get it.

03:51.590 --> 03:53.250
I won't waste my breath on you.

04:02.240 --> 04:02.870
Ms. Liang.

04:03.960 --> 04:04.360
Ms. Liang.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.090
Lady Yunwan.

04:06.150 --> 04:07.590
Ms. Liang, why are you ignoring me?

04:07.590 --> 04:09.280
Ms. Liang!

04:09.710 --> 04:10.360
Ms. Liang!

04:10.470 --> 04:12.280
-Lady Yunwan.
-Ms. Liang, look at me!

04:12.280 --> 04:13.520
Ms. Liang, look at me!

04:14.230 --> 04:14.960
Lady Yunwan.

04:15.120 --> 04:15.750
Ms. Liang!

04:16.140 --> 04:16.870
Lady Yunwan.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.269
Let me go!

04:20.360 --> 04:21.680
-Ms. Liang!
-It's all right.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.540
It's all right.

04:23.600 --> 04:24.920
Ms. Liang!

04:25.190 --> 04:25.920
Lady Yunwan.

04:26.190 --> 04:27.510
Ms. Liang!

04:29.680 --> 04:30.920
-Ms. Liang!
-It's all right.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.050
Everything's fine.

04:32.360 --> 04:33.360
Ms. Liang!

04:33.720 --> 04:35.310
Ms. Liang!

04:39.480 --> 04:41.040
Ms. Liang!

04:44.000 --> 04:45.600
Ms. Liang!

04:45.720 --> 04:46.450
Lady Yunwan.

04:50.430 --> 04:52.510
Ms. Liang!

04:58.000 --> 04:59.680
Let me go!

05:01.000 --> 05:01.870
-It's all right.
-Ms. Liang!

05:01.870 --> 05:02.750
It's all right.

05:17.720 --> 05:18.520
Lady Shanbao.

05:18.870 --> 05:20.270
I've tried my best,

05:20.510 --> 05:22.470
but I still can't persuade Lady Yunwan.

05:22.470 --> 05:24.870
She refuses to go down the mountain
with us.

05:26.670 --> 05:28.470
Let her stay here a while longer.

05:49.190 --> 05:49.870
Godmother,

05:51.870 --> 05:53.870
I hope that for the rest of your life,

05:53.960 --> 05:56.020
you'll be free from worry and resentment,

05:56.020 --> 05:57.950
with a heart untroubled and light.

07:01.500 --> 07:06.430
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

07:01.920 --> 07:03.720
You've been waiting here for me?

07:08.250 --> 07:13.240
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

07:12.680 --> 07:14.980
If one day, Mr. Lu turns
against the Rong family,

07:14.980 --> 07:19.750
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

07:15.560 --> 07:17.160
he will become my enemy.

07:17.750 --> 07:19.350
I will sever all ties with him

07:20.370 --> 07:26.200
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

07:20.390 --> 07:21.590
and show him no mercy.

07:21.800 --> 07:22.810
That's not enough!

07:22.810 --> 07:24.610
Swear it on your life and future.

07:26.950 --> 07:28.430
Before the ancestral tablets
of the Rong family,

07:27.070 --> 07:33.120
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

07:28.430 --> 07:29.360
I've sworn

07:30.480 --> 07:31.870
that if my husband acts

07:32.600 --> 07:33.920
against the Rong family's interests,

07:33.630 --> 07:39.659
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

07:34.680 --> 07:36.340
I must sever all ties with him,

07:37.000 --> 07:38.600
or else face a broken family,

07:38.830 --> 07:39.750
a shortened life

07:39.750 --> 07:40.800
and a terrible death.

07:40.340 --> 07:46.250
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

07:41.510 --> 07:42.120
Surely you don't want me

07:42.120 --> 07:43.920
to suffer such punishment, do you?

07:43.920 --> 07:44.580
Go back now.

07:45.390 --> 07:46.560
And do not come to see me again.

07:46.280 --> 07:52.750
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

07:48.360 --> 07:49.020
Let go of me.

07:53.180 --> 07:56.530
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

07:56.560 --> 07:59.740
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

07:57.480 --> 07:58.540
We're not married.

07:59.159 --> 08:00.030
The oath is not in effect yet.

08:00.030 --> 08:02.280
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

08:00.600 --> 08:01.530
As for children,

08:01.870 --> 08:03.390
I'm perfectly content with you alone,

08:02.310 --> 08:06.380
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

08:03.560 --> 08:04.510
so I don't care.

08:04.830 --> 08:07.120
Now that the entire Wei clan
has been exonerated,

08:06.560 --> 08:10.130
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

08:07.390 --> 08:08.790
they are so grateful to me

08:08.870 --> 08:10.160
that they want to set up a tablet
to pray for my long life.

08:10.160 --> 08:13.180
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

08:10.430 --> 08:12.690
I told them it should be dedicated to you.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.270
Had you not protected Madam Yang,

08:13.240 --> 08:19.520
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

08:14.270 --> 08:16.360
their names could never have been cleared.

08:16.360 --> 08:17.750
All the boundless merit accrued

08:17.750 --> 08:18.680
from saving over 200 lives of their clan

08:18.680 --> 08:19.540
belongs to you.

08:19.830 --> 08:21.160
I, Lu Jianglai, act only

08:21.310 --> 08:22.910
according to my conscience.

08:22.920 --> 08:24.920
I've never feared any karmic retribution.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.380
Bao, since you are afraid,

08:26.750 --> 08:29.950
I'll take an oath right here,
in front of the Bodhisattva.

08:30.430 --> 08:32.549
If there truly is karmic reward
for good deeds,

08:32.549 --> 08:34.750
Bodhisattva, I pray you grant Lady Shanbao

08:34.750 --> 08:37.150
blessings, longevity, peace and health.

08:37.840 --> 08:38.960
As for the bitter retribution

08:38.960 --> 08:40.669
of a shortened life and a terrible death,

08:40.669 --> 08:42.000
let me bear it all alone.

08:48.150 --> 08:49.550
If you stop pestering me,

08:49.980 --> 08:51.320
that will be my karmic reward.

08:51.320 --> 08:51.780
Let go of me.

08:51.780 --> 08:52.380
I won't!

08:52.910 --> 08:53.640
Lu Jianglai.

08:54.480 --> 08:56.200
Now that you've taken the road
to high office,

08:56.200 --> 08:57.670
you can't come to see me anymore.

08:57.670 --> 08:58.840
You can't have it both ways.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.390
To hell with high office!

09:00.960 --> 09:02.480
Had I wanted power and fortune,

09:02.480 --> 09:02.910
I wouldn't have cared

09:02.910 --> 09:04.570
about the fate of the Wei clan.

09:04.910 --> 09:05.320
Yes,

09:06.720 --> 09:07.910
I am ruthless

09:08.270 --> 09:09.270
and calculating.

09:09.370 --> 09:10.360
But if I don't want to collude

09:10.360 --> 09:12.390
with those corrupt
and incompetent officials,

09:12.390 --> 09:13.120
I must be

09:13.120 --> 09:14.380
more cunning than them

09:14.670 --> 09:16.240
to beat them at their own game

09:16.240 --> 09:17.900
and secure the justice I seek.

09:18.030 --> 09:19.090
Bao, you're right.

09:19.990 --> 09:21.590
I want to have it both ways.

09:22.120 --> 09:23.720
I will see this case through to the end.

09:23.720 --> 09:24.200
And...

09:25.360 --> 09:26.620
I will never let you go.

09:27.120 --> 09:29.060
You can beat me or kill me as you please.

09:29.060 --> 09:30.260
But even if I die,

09:30.610 --> 09:32.480
my spirit will cling to you
and never let you go.

09:32.480 --> 09:33.000
Even if you summon

09:33.000 --> 09:34.630
every god in heaven to your side,

09:34.630 --> 09:36.490
you still won't be able to stop me.

09:45.240 --> 09:45.670
Good.

09:46.750 --> 09:47.840
You said it.

09:48.840 --> 09:50.320
On that misty mountain peak,

09:50.320 --> 09:52.120
there's an ancient wild tea tree

09:52.630 --> 09:54.030
growing on a steep cliff.

09:54.600 --> 09:55.910
It's bathed in the essence
of sun and moon

09:55.910 --> 09:57.550
and nurtured by the spirit
of mountains and rivers.

09:57.550 --> 09:59.750
Legend says its tea can cure dysentery,

10:00.030 --> 10:02.320
making the tea leaves
more valuable than gold.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.960
During every tea-picking season,

10:03.960 --> 10:06.390
many mountain folk risk their lives
to climb the peak for the leaves.

10:06.390 --> 10:08.590
Scarcely one in ten makes it back alive.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.080
If you get the leaves yourself

10:10.080 --> 10:11.510
and bring them to me,

10:12.080 --> 10:13.390
no matter how grave your mistakes
have been,

10:13.390 --> 10:14.990
we can still work things out.

10:15.390 --> 10:16.590
Do you really mean it?

10:20.360 --> 10:21.960
You're not just saying that?

10:22.950 --> 10:24.010
Every word is true.

10:25.730 --> 10:28.570
Good. I will definitely get them for you.

10:48.830 --> 10:50.120
It has been two days

10:50.630 --> 10:52.230
since we parted at the court.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.440
I just want you to know

10:55.670 --> 10:57.130
I've been thinking of you.

11:01.870 --> 11:02.870
It's alright now.

11:03.750 --> 11:05.910
I've missed the best hour
for tea-picking today.

11:05.910 --> 11:08.440
I'll go up the mountain
first thing tomorrow.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.150
Wait for me.

11:53.790 --> 11:54.840
Lady Rong Shanbao

11:55.270 --> 11:56.840
really knows how to make people suffer.

11:56.840 --> 11:58.390
We've asked every hunter
at the foot of the mountain,

11:58.390 --> 11:59.910
but none of them has ever heard

11:59.910 --> 12:01.840
of any tea tree on the mountain top.

12:01.840 --> 12:03.270
This is probably a wild goose chase,

12:03.270 --> 12:04.720
but you're taking it seriously!

12:04.720 --> 12:06.490
Beauty is but skin deep.

12:06.670 --> 12:08.200
All passions are phantoms,

12:08.200 --> 12:09.600
yet you're just blinded!

12:09.600 --> 12:11.390
If the tea tree really grows
on that sheer cliff,

12:11.390 --> 12:13.190
then she's asking for your life!

12:13.200 --> 12:14.150
In this life,

12:14.630 --> 12:16.080
fame, fortune, glory and wealth

12:16.080 --> 12:17.340
are all just phantoms.

12:18.030 --> 12:19.360
To fulfill my lofty ambitions,

12:19.360 --> 12:21.120
I can endure ten years
of shame and humiliation,

12:21.120 --> 12:22.440
living in austerity and privation.

12:22.440 --> 12:22.910
For my beloved,

12:22.910 --> 12:24.720
a little suffering
is a small price to pay.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.360
If Rong Shanbao

12:25.360 --> 12:26.490
truly wants my life,

12:26.790 --> 12:28.670
then she'll have to offer
something far more precious in return.

12:28.670 --> 12:29.720
Something more precious?

12:29.720 --> 12:30.780
What would that be?

12:34.240 --> 12:34.840
Her heart,

12:35.440 --> 12:36.120
the rest of her life

12:36.120 --> 12:37.450
and everything she has.

12:38.150 --> 12:39.610
I'll accept nothing less.

12:40.030 --> 12:41.200
You're quite wicked.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.600
You two are truly a match.

12:44.190 --> 12:45.450
Let me rest for a while.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.000
Just a moment.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.850
I told you not to follow me.

12:50.200 --> 12:50.670
Once it's past 9 AM,

12:50.670 --> 12:52.390
I'll miss the best time for tea-picking.

12:52.390 --> 12:53.120
I can't wait.

12:53.870 --> 12:54.670
Wait for me!

12:56.840 --> 12:57.630
What is this?

13:03.050 --> 13:04.030
You damn monkey.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.320
You damn monkey!

13:06.800 --> 13:07.800
How dare you duck!

13:08.870 --> 13:09.270
I...

13:10.960 --> 13:11.670
Wait for me!

13:19.120 --> 13:20.050
Where's Lord Lu?

13:20.390 --> 13:21.720
He went up the mountain.

14:48.140 --> 14:52.800
♪ Get caught in a heavy, wild snowfall ♪

14:52.880 --> 14:56.610
♪ Watch magpies fluttering past my eyes ♪

14:56.810 --> 15:00.970
♪ It's tormenting itself all alone ♪

14:59.080 --> 15:01.190
If one day, Mr. Lu turns
against the Rong family,

15:01.190 --> 15:05.290
♪ Unable to find any peers
for a get-together ♪

15:01.950 --> 15:03.460
he will become my enemy.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.840
I will sever all ties with him

15:05.640 --> 15:09.800
♪ Wait for a perfectly full moon ♪

15:06.960 --> 15:08.160
and show him no mercy.

15:08.510 --> 15:09.570
That's not enough!

15:09.810 --> 15:14.110
♪ Yet every slice of it seems incomplete ♪

15:10.270 --> 15:11.270
If that day comes,

15:11.870 --> 15:14.140
I want you to punish him
with your own hands.

15:14.140 --> 15:18.110
♪ Is it because my prayers
are too presumptuous? ♪

15:14.200 --> 15:16.030
If you hesitate for even a moment,

15:16.030 --> 15:18.350
you are not worthy to be a daughter
of our Rong family.

15:18.350 --> 15:23.120
♪ Or do I lack a bit
of the sacrificial blood? ♪

15:23.660 --> 15:28.170
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

15:28.290 --> 15:32.680
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

15:33.370 --> 15:35.790
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

15:35.820 --> 15:38.460
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

15:38.490 --> 15:41.060
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

15:41.110 --> 15:45.370
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

15:45.390 --> 15:49.960
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

15:50.540 --> 15:53.740
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

15:53.770 --> 15:57.590
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

15:58.100 --> 16:01.650
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

16:16.720 --> 16:17.850
Why the hesitation?

16:20.510 --> 16:21.440
Why are you here?

16:23.030 --> 16:24.440
Why did Grandmother order you
to kneel

16:24.440 --> 16:25.700
in the ancestral hall?

16:26.270 --> 16:27.240
She wanted you to see

16:27.240 --> 16:28.840
the fate of that wretched servant.

16:28.840 --> 16:31.120
In the past, anyone who dared to sell

16:31.120 --> 16:33.030
the salt or gold mines
their clan depended on

16:33.030 --> 16:34.670
would be tried and hanged publicly.

16:34.670 --> 16:36.510
Even if the chief's husband
betrayed the clan,

16:36.510 --> 16:38.200
he would be thrown into a scorpion pit,

16:38.200 --> 16:39.800
his survival left to chance.

16:41.480 --> 16:42.440
He was a spy
who infiltrated the Rong family

16:42.440 --> 16:43.590
to gather information.

16:43.590 --> 16:45.190
It was you who saved his life.

16:45.360 --> 16:47.240
Even if he falls and shatters to pieces,

16:47.240 --> 16:49.370
it'll only be repaying his debt to you.

16:50.270 --> 16:51.670
If you can't bear to do it,

16:51.790 --> 16:53.190
I can do it on your behalf.

16:56.860 --> 16:58.720
It's not that I can't bear to do it.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.120
Still denying it?

17:02.200 --> 17:04.680
You are not the only daughter
of the Rong family.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.210
If you hesitate any longer,

17:06.750 --> 17:09.150
you will surely ruin the important matter.

17:10.750 --> 17:12.010
Think about my mother.

17:12.510 --> 17:13.349
Grandmother doted on her

17:13.349 --> 17:14.480
beyond all measure.

17:14.790 --> 17:16.550
But since she insisted
on marrying far from home,

17:16.550 --> 17:17.500
for all these years,

17:17.500 --> 17:19.160
has Grandmother ever mentioned her
even once?

17:19.160 --> 17:20.640
She was no longer part of the Rong family.

17:20.640 --> 17:22.589
After she died, she couldn't be buried
in the family grave.

17:22.589 --> 17:23.750
Even I, as her daughter,

17:23.750 --> 17:25.079
become an outsider now,

17:25.880 --> 17:28.480
not worthy of being recorded
in the genealogy.

17:29.640 --> 17:30.510
So what?

17:31.610 --> 17:32.410
So what?

17:38.350 --> 17:39.200
Rong Shanbao.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.110
When you were 13 or 14,

17:41.370 --> 17:43.320
you followed the tea caravan to the border
for training.

17:43.320 --> 17:45.640
In three years, you only stayed home
for 20 days.

17:45.640 --> 17:47.480
Driving camels, judging horses
and speaking tribal tongues...

17:47.480 --> 17:48.740
You mastered them all.

17:48.880 --> 17:51.130
Once, you got separated from the caravan.

17:51.130 --> 17:52.590
You fought tooth and nail
to find a water source,

17:52.590 --> 17:53.160
and on your own, led

17:53.160 --> 17:55.020
several camels back to the group.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.590
Not a single item was lost.

17:56.590 --> 17:58.270
You even traded tea bricks for 30 sheep,

17:58.270 --> 17:59.790
earning 100 extra taels of silver.

17:59.790 --> 18:01.240
Back then,
whenever Grandmother mentioned you,

18:01.240 --> 18:02.840
she was bursting with pride.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.270
But now?

18:04.960 --> 18:06.240
For Lu Jianglai

18:06.590 --> 18:08.270
and an outsider like Madam Yang,

18:08.270 --> 18:10.350
you willingly turned your back
on Grandmother.

18:10.350 --> 18:10.960
You have failed

18:10.960 --> 18:12.680
the Rong family that has spared no effort
to cultivate you.

18:12.680 --> 18:13.270
You have failed

18:13.270 --> 18:15.030
the tea farmers
who worship you as the Tea Bone.

18:15.030 --> 18:16.110
Most of all, you've

18:16.110 --> 18:17.270
failed yourself!

18:22.680 --> 18:25.270
Whether family honor
or personal romance

18:25.960 --> 18:27.220
weighs more heavily

18:28.510 --> 18:30.170
is for you to decide yourself.

18:40.240 --> 18:40.900
Xiangling.

18:42.550 --> 18:44.210
This isn't about family honor

18:44.550 --> 18:45.810
and personal romance.

18:46.910 --> 18:49.430
Yes, I am upset with Lu Jianglai.

18:50.440 --> 18:51.590
I'm angry that he acted on his own

18:51.590 --> 18:52.520
and deceived me.

18:53.710 --> 18:56.230
But he didn't do anything wrong.

18:57.400 --> 19:00.400
He infiltrated the Rong family
to investigate a case.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.440
He was willing to set me aside temporarily

19:02.440 --> 19:04.040
for the justice in his heart,

19:04.430 --> 19:06.090
just as I did for my godmother.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.740
Knowing the grievances she carried,

19:08.750 --> 19:09.920
I set aside all favor temporarily

19:09.920 --> 19:11.110
to protect her.

19:12.030 --> 19:13.230
So about this matter,

19:13.310 --> 19:14.770
though I'm angry with him,

19:15.270 --> 19:16.720
I understand him.

19:18.070 --> 19:19.070
I'm grateful that

19:19.880 --> 19:20.790
on this point,

19:21.510 --> 19:22.710
he and I see eye to eye.

19:24.590 --> 19:25.990
The Rong family and Linji

19:26.070 --> 19:28.310
are interdependent
like branches and leaves.

19:28.310 --> 19:30.960
I'm guarding the Rong family's future,

19:31.710 --> 19:34.360
while he's protecting Linji's future.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.860
If Linji falls into darkness,

19:37.550 --> 19:39.680
the Rong family
will also be plunged into darkness.

19:39.680 --> 19:40.680
Isn't that right?

19:45.640 --> 19:46.840
I know you care for me,

19:47.440 --> 19:48.100
and that you hope

19:48.100 --> 19:49.880
once I become the head of the Rong family,

19:49.880 --> 19:51.350
I'll help you reclaim your surname

19:51.350 --> 19:53.350
and have your name recorded
in our genealogy.

19:53.350 --> 19:55.670
Xiangling, I will keep the promise

19:56.640 --> 19:57.550
I made to you.

20:14.660 --> 20:15.460
Let's go back.

21:09.550 --> 21:10.270
Ms. Liang.

21:12.790 --> 21:13.550
I picked all these

21:13.550 --> 21:14.510
from the backyard.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.970
Look, aren't they pretty?

21:16.640 --> 21:17.510
They are.

21:18.590 --> 21:20.120
This leaf is even prettier.

21:20.750 --> 21:21.920
Look at it.

21:28.070 --> 21:29.000
Lady Yunwan.

21:30.270 --> 21:31.930
By the stream at the back hill,

21:32.030 --> 21:33.940
there's a beautiful red maple tree,

21:33.940 --> 21:36.440
more splendid than spring flowers
in February.

21:36.440 --> 21:38.030
Could you pick a leaf for me?

21:38.670 --> 21:39.480
Please?

21:41.590 --> 21:43.920
Wait for me, Ms. Liang.
I'll be right back.

21:44.850 --> 21:45.480
Wanwan.

22:08.130 --> 22:10.960
Watch your step. Don't trip and fall.

22:25.490 --> 22:30.810
[Rong Mansion]

22:35.030 --> 22:36.890
Lord Lu, you've come at a bad time.

22:37.510 --> 22:39.550
There's an outbreak of tea plant disease
in the plantations after the rain.

22:39.550 --> 22:41.400
Lady Shanbao
has gone up to the tea mountain.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.550
Based on previous years,

22:42.550 --> 22:43.640
she might be gone for 3 to 5 days,

22:43.640 --> 22:45.300
or even 10 days to half a month.

22:45.430 --> 22:47.430
It's impossible to say for certain.

22:47.510 --> 22:49.270
I dare not have you wait in vain, My Lord.

22:49.270 --> 22:50.640
Save these excuses.

22:51.590 --> 22:52.480
I've had a prior arrangement

22:52.480 --> 22:53.540
with Lady Shanbao.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.060
Just take this basket inside.

22:56.350 --> 22:57.610
And tell her I have a way

22:58.070 --> 22:59.510
to bring the cliff tea
she's been longing for

22:59.510 --> 23:00.750
down from the mountain.

23:00.750 --> 23:02.610
She will naturally come to see me.

23:10.000 --> 23:11.060
Take it inside now.

23:36.270 --> 23:38.030
The marten fur cloak
you just started wearing yesterday

23:38.030 --> 23:39.690
got torn as soon as we went out.

23:39.720 --> 23:40.680
What a pity!

23:41.510 --> 23:42.440
Actually, this old one

23:42.440 --> 23:44.030
is more comfortable to wear.

23:44.030 --> 23:45.110
The late autumn air is quite cold.

23:45.110 --> 23:46.720
The old one isn't warm enough.

23:46.720 --> 23:47.750
I'm just worried that you'll

23:47.750 --> 23:48.640
catch a chill.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.130
What's this for?

23:53.550 --> 23:54.550
Mr. Yan,

23:55.030 --> 23:55.590
someone delivered this

23:55.590 --> 23:57.110
to our gate early this morning

23:57.110 --> 23:59.510
Steward Cheng just told me
to throw it away.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.440
There are quite a few

24:01.440 --> 24:02.790
freshly cut twigs inside it.

24:02.790 --> 24:03.790
Why throw it away?

24:04.920 --> 24:05.380
This...

24:05.870 --> 24:06.670
Leave it to me.

24:38.510 --> 24:39.770
What are you two doing?

24:42.400 --> 24:43.200
Lady Shanbao.

24:49.000 --> 24:50.330
I told you not to meddle.

24:50.920 --> 24:53.380
These cuttings need to be planted
at a slant.

24:53.880 --> 24:54.790
But I did everything

24:54.790 --> 24:57.120
exactly as you instructed, Young Master.

24:59.030 --> 25:01.290
Mr. Yan, you're an expert at growing tea,

25:01.590 --> 25:02.510
yet you have an attendant

25:02.510 --> 25:04.510
who knows next to nothing about tea.

25:05.960 --> 25:06.820
Watch closely.

25:10.750 --> 25:12.880
The northwest wind
is blowing strong right now.

25:12.880 --> 25:15.960
We should position the leaves
so that they follow the wind direction.

25:15.960 --> 25:18.310
If the wind is too strong,
the leaves will fall off.

25:18.310 --> 25:20.310
The leaf buds on this branch
aren't full enough.

25:20.310 --> 25:22.550
It's difficult for the cutting
to take root.

25:22.550 --> 25:22.920
I...

25:22.920 --> 25:24.920
Wild tea trees grow on steep cliffs.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.510
Even plucking their leaves
is a perilous task,

25:26.510 --> 25:29.040
let alone cutting branches
for propagation.

25:29.680 --> 25:32.680
Someone risked their life
to obtain the precious tea.

25:32.750 --> 25:33.440
I thought

25:33.920 --> 25:36.310
it would be too wasteful
to throw them away.

25:36.310 --> 25:38.240
So I brought them here to have a try.

25:41.960 --> 25:43.360
Lord Lu has come to visit.

25:43.590 --> 25:45.190
Why didn't anyone inform me?

25:46.920 --> 25:47.790
It seems that someone, seeing

25:47.790 --> 25:49.480
I've lost Grandmother's favor,

25:49.480 --> 25:51.740
now thinks they can dismiss me entirely.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.640
So many have fallen to their deaths

25:53.640 --> 25:55.550
picking tea leaves on those cliffs.

25:55.550 --> 25:57.280
He really does have great luck.

25:58.010 --> 25:58.810
Lady Shanbao.

25:59.830 --> 26:00.680
He has been waiting for you outside

26:00.680 --> 26:01.940
for two hours already.

26:03.400 --> 26:05.920
Lady Shanbao, you've always been true
to your word and deed.

26:05.920 --> 26:06.590
When have you ever

26:06.590 --> 26:07.850
gone back on your word?

26:09.320 --> 26:10.720
You promised to meet him.

26:11.140 --> 26:12.870
How can you break your promise?

26:13.900 --> 26:15.340
Go to meet him.

26:24.960 --> 26:26.070
What a pity.

26:27.200 --> 26:28.860
He personally said he had a way

26:28.920 --> 26:29.960
to bring the precious cliff tea

26:29.960 --> 26:31.290
down from the mountain.

26:31.720 --> 26:33.250
Since you refuse to see him,

26:33.400 --> 26:34.680
this tea tree will

26:34.680 --> 26:35.990
-have to stay...
-Mr. Yan.

26:35.990 --> 26:36.640
Thank you.

26:47.860 --> 26:49.240
Young Master, you're too silly.

26:49.240 --> 26:50.160
You got your hands all muddy,

26:50.160 --> 26:52.820
doing all this work
for someone else's benefit.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.680
What's easily gained

26:56.440 --> 26:57.840
is never rare or special.

26:59.030 --> 27:01.490
Only what everyone yearns for
but can't have

27:01.590 --> 27:02.790
is truly precious.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.850
Let's get back to work.

27:09.830 --> 27:11.890
My Lord, I have urgent news to report.

27:19.020 --> 27:20.710
[Rong Mansion]

27:23.350 --> 27:25.150
Go up the mountain immediately.

27:43.030 --> 27:45.470
Has he already left?

27:48.350 --> 27:49.150
Lady Shanbao.

27:49.310 --> 27:50.710
Mr. Lu asked me to tell you

27:50.720 --> 27:51.770
something terrible had happened
at Jijian Nunnery.

27:51.770 --> 27:54.190
Hurry up and go up the mountain
to check it out.

27:54.190 --> 27:55.110
Prepare a horse.

27:55.110 --> 27:55.510
Yes.

27:56.270 --> 27:57.400
Where are you going?

28:11.110 --> 28:12.240
Come inside with me.

28:35.510 --> 28:36.440
Remove the body.

28:43.880 --> 28:44.610
You're here.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.890
What happened?

28:59.150 --> 29:00.960
When the nuns gathered
for evening prayers,

29:00.960 --> 29:03.070
they noticed she was nowhere to be seen.

29:03.070 --> 29:05.200
Later they found out
something bad had happened.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.440
The coroner has examined the body.

29:06.440 --> 29:08.370
There were no wounds on her body

29:09.030 --> 29:10.490
and no signs of poisoning.

29:10.750 --> 29:13.080
It has been confirmed she hanged herself.

29:32.960 --> 29:35.160
Madam Yang made an excuse
to send Lady Yunwan away.

29:35.160 --> 29:37.350
Then she hanged herself alone in her room.

29:37.350 --> 29:38.520
When Lady Yunwan arrived here,

29:38.520 --> 29:41.320
the nuns
had already taken down Madam Yang's body.

29:41.860 --> 29:43.750
I was afraid Lady Yunwan
would make a scene and cause disruption,

29:43.750 --> 29:44.880
so I ordered someone

29:45.010 --> 29:46.590
to forcibly take her away to have a rest.

29:46.590 --> 29:48.920
What she had desperately tried to protect

29:49.310 --> 29:50.780
was ultimately lost.

29:54.110 --> 29:55.310
If she finds this out,

29:56.680 --> 29:59.080
I can't imagine how heartbroken she'll be.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.440
Take everyone from the nunnery

30:07.440 --> 30:09.170
back to the Government Office!

30:10.000 --> 30:11.660
I'll question them one by one.

30:13.550 --> 30:16.310
Grandmother, Yunwan is a member
of the Rong family.

30:16.310 --> 30:17.880
She shouldn't stay
on the mountain for long.

30:17.880 --> 30:19.080
Grandmother, please

30:19.510 --> 30:21.240
allow me to bring her back soon.

30:21.920 --> 30:24.580
You know whether you're going
to Jijian Nunnery

30:25.600 --> 30:27.210
because of Wanwan

30:28.070 --> 30:29.920
or out of concern for Madam Yang's safety.

30:29.920 --> 30:31.720
I only have one question for you.

30:32.000 --> 30:34.860
I've told you
to reflect on your mistake these days.

30:35.480 --> 30:37.200
Do you realize where you went wrong?

30:37.200 --> 30:38.510
Grandmother, I have taken

30:38.510 --> 30:39.920
your words to heart.

30:40.550 --> 30:41.440
From now on, for everything I do,

30:41.440 --> 30:43.200
I will first seek your instruction.

30:43.200 --> 30:44.460
I'll never act on my own

30:44.480 --> 30:45.880
or do things recklessly.

30:46.640 --> 30:48.830
It's good
that you've realized your mistake.

30:48.830 --> 30:50.630
Since Madam Yang has taken vows,

30:51.030 --> 30:53.070
she has cut all ties with the mortal world

30:53.070 --> 30:54.820
and is no longer your godmother.

30:54.820 --> 30:55.820
As for Wanwan,

30:56.480 --> 30:59.280
our Rong family
has already held a funeral for her.

31:00.110 --> 31:01.270
Everyone knows

31:02.590 --> 31:04.830
that Lady Yunwan of the Rong family
is dead.

31:04.830 --> 31:06.030
It's better this way.

31:06.350 --> 31:06.960
Such

31:06.960 --> 31:08.270
a foolish child

31:08.440 --> 31:10.680
should never have been born
into the Rong family.

31:10.680 --> 31:11.880
She herself suffered

31:12.880 --> 31:14.590
and also disgraced the whole family.

31:14.590 --> 31:15.590
All these years,

31:15.590 --> 31:16.830
as her elder sister,

31:16.830 --> 31:18.400
you have spent so much effort

31:18.400 --> 31:20.200
and endured so much ridicule for her.

31:20.200 --> 31:21.200
Outsiders might even think

31:21.200 --> 31:23.400
that our Rong family
must have committed terrible sins

31:23.400 --> 31:24.590
to have raised

31:24.590 --> 31:26.480
such an ignorant and shameful child.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.740
I think there's no need to bring her back.

31:28.960 --> 31:31.240
Let her remain on the mountain
to recuperate in peace.

31:31.240 --> 31:32.590
I will send someone else

31:32.660 --> 31:34.590
to deliver all her daily necessities.

31:34.590 --> 31:36.830
You'd better act
as if you never had this sibling.

31:36.830 --> 31:39.110
Focus all your attention
on the matters of the tea plantations.

31:39.110 --> 31:39.910
Grandmother.

31:40.750 --> 31:42.720
Yunwan is a daughter of the Rong family,

31:42.720 --> 31:44.350
my own blood sister.

31:45.070 --> 31:45.880
How could I bear to leave her

31:45.880 --> 31:47.880
stranded for good
in that lonely nunnery on the mountain

31:47.880 --> 31:49.320
and never allow her
to return the Rong Mansion?

31:49.320 --> 31:51.850
You claim
that you've realized your mistake!

31:51.880 --> 31:53.590
But I see you're clearly incorrigible.

31:53.590 --> 31:54.400
Grandmother.

31:54.400 --> 31:55.350
Shut up!

32:02.030 --> 32:03.030
I was reckless.

32:03.680 --> 32:05.480
Grandmother, please calm down.

32:06.210 --> 32:07.180
But Wanwan...

32:07.210 --> 32:08.070
Old Madam Rong.

32:11.030 --> 32:13.030
Old Madam Rong,
there's a message from the mountain.

32:13.030 --> 32:13.590
It says

32:13.850 --> 32:16.050
Madam Yang has hanged herself and died.

32:21.890 --> 32:24.890
No. That can't be true.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.440
How pitiful.

32:27.880 --> 32:30.410
She had clung to a wretched life
for ten years,

32:30.440 --> 32:31.660
but in the end, she still couldn't escape

32:31.660 --> 32:32.990
her destined calamity.

32:33.590 --> 32:35.510
This shows
every person has their own destiny.

32:35.510 --> 32:37.240
Now matter how capable you are,

32:37.510 --> 32:39.170
you still can't stop destiny.

32:39.720 --> 32:40.720
For her,

32:41.510 --> 32:43.710
it was actually an end to her suffering.

32:45.270 --> 32:47.000
If you feel compassion for her,

32:47.070 --> 32:48.270
then spend more money

32:48.880 --> 32:50.480
and give her a proper burial.

32:51.350 --> 32:54.790
Grandmother, Yunwan
has just suffered this sudden misfortune.

32:54.790 --> 32:56.320
She must be very terrified.

32:56.750 --> 32:58.310
Grandmother, I beg you to allow me

32:58.310 --> 32:59.830
to go up the mountain immediately

32:59.830 --> 33:00.890
and bring her back.

33:01.350 --> 33:03.400
I've told you
that you're not allowed to go!

33:03.400 --> 33:04.400
Stop right there!

33:05.640 --> 33:06.440
Rong Shanbao.

33:06.960 --> 33:09.620
Have you forgotten the rules
of the Rong family?

33:14.270 --> 33:15.070
Grandmother.

33:16.170 --> 33:19.030
Our Rong ancestors belonged
to a matrilineal clan.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.160
We honor women,

33:21.590 --> 33:23.190
and we never look down on men.

33:23.920 --> 33:25.920
The men of the clan hunted and fought,

33:25.920 --> 33:27.720
while the women took care of their homes.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.250
Together, they built a land

33:29.270 --> 33:30.730
of peace and tranquility.

33:31.350 --> 33:33.070
That land was once vast.

33:34.030 --> 33:34.550
It was so vast that it could

33:34.550 --> 33:36.080
shelter countless people.

33:37.240 --> 33:39.240
When destitute strangers arrived,

33:39.720 --> 33:41.270
they could get clean food,

33:41.920 --> 33:42.960
warm clothes,

33:43.600 --> 33:44.930
and even a piece of land.

33:45.750 --> 33:46.510
From then on,

33:47.590 --> 33:48.240
they became

33:48.240 --> 33:49.480
members of our clan.

33:52.390 --> 33:53.990
These heartwarming stories

33:54.640 --> 33:56.070
were all told to me by you.

33:57.480 --> 33:58.240
It was you

33:58.650 --> 34:00.510
who made our ancestors my ideals.

34:01.350 --> 34:02.950
You always talk about rules,

34:03.590 --> 34:05.350
but the laws of the jungle

34:06.110 --> 34:08.030
and those self-serving doctrines

34:08.030 --> 34:09.710
have never been our rules.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.280
By our rules,

34:11.989 --> 34:14.000
we would never cast aside frail elders

34:14.000 --> 34:15.260
or disabled children,

34:15.710 --> 34:16.280
would never disdain

34:16.280 --> 34:18.030
a sister who is mentally challenged,

34:18.030 --> 34:18.760
would never turn away

34:18.760 --> 34:19.670
a granddaughter who has traveled so far

34:19.670 --> 34:20.670
to find her roots,

34:21.190 --> 34:21.920
and would never, knowing

34:21.920 --> 34:23.150
a woman is innocent,

34:23.920 --> 34:25.480
stand idly by and watch her

34:25.670 --> 34:28.070
suffer injustice and be driven to despair.

34:29.280 --> 34:30.070
Never.

34:30.420 --> 34:31.010
You!

34:32.989 --> 34:34.590
How dare you accuse me,

34:36.320 --> 34:38.110
your own grandmother!

34:40.670 --> 34:41.280
Shanbao,

34:41.630 --> 34:43.400
how can you speak to Grandmother
like this?

34:43.400 --> 34:45.130
Apologize to Grandmother now.

34:45.389 --> 34:47.790
Hurry!
Don't you see you're driving me mad?

34:51.820 --> 34:52.620
Grandmother,

34:53.980 --> 34:55.020
I was wrong.

34:57.110 --> 34:58.070
My mistake was

34:59.110 --> 35:01.040
being blindly obedient and filial

35:01.580 --> 35:03.380
and not speaking my mind sooner.

35:06.230 --> 35:08.160
You scolded my father and my uncles

35:08.260 --> 35:10.000
for abandoning their families,

35:10.000 --> 35:11.060
chasing after fame

35:11.590 --> 35:13.800
and leaving the tea plantations behind.

35:13.800 --> 35:14.800
But you yourself,

35:15.280 --> 35:16.280
over these years,

35:17.590 --> 35:18.880
have also strayed

35:19.760 --> 35:20.550
too far.

35:21.630 --> 35:22.800
You value power

35:23.360 --> 35:24.280
and prestige

35:24.840 --> 35:26.550
more than your own family.

35:27.510 --> 35:28.230
You value them

35:28.230 --> 35:30.720
more than your granddaughters
bound to you by blood.

35:30.720 --> 35:32.840
It has been so long

35:33.440 --> 35:34.920
since you told us

35:35.400 --> 35:37.030
about the sacred mountains
in our homeland,

35:37.030 --> 35:38.230
the ancient palaces,

35:38.760 --> 35:39.630
and that queen

35:39.940 --> 35:41.940
who would sit under the cypress tree

35:42.330 --> 35:43.070
teaching children

35:43.070 --> 35:44.400
how to make tea bricks.

35:56.590 --> 35:57.720
Where are you going?

35:58.550 --> 35:59.280
I'm going to gather the remains

35:59.280 --> 36:00.920
of a poor woman

36:01.670 --> 36:03.070
and bring my sister home.

36:03.330 --> 36:05.070
How dare you defy Grandmother like this!

36:05.070 --> 36:06.370
It's utterly disrespectful!

36:06.370 --> 36:07.040
Shut up!

36:11.000 --> 36:11.800
Rong Shanbao.

36:12.400 --> 36:13.330
If you go out now,

36:14.440 --> 36:15.480
you know

36:15.480 --> 36:16.480
what you'll lose.

36:17.090 --> 36:18.890
If you dare step out of that door,

36:19.440 --> 36:21.100
you'll never be allowed back!

36:34.360 --> 36:35.440
I started the new tea plantations

36:35.440 --> 36:36.900
on Green Mountain myself.

36:37.150 --> 36:38.680
I'll live there from now on.

36:39.440 --> 36:40.070
But I will always be

36:40.070 --> 36:41.620
a daughter of the Rong family

36:41.620 --> 36:43.020
and your granddaughter.

36:43.760 --> 36:46.110
Whenever the Rong family needs me

36:47.000 --> 36:48.330
or whenever you miss me,

36:48.630 --> 36:49.560
I will come back.

36:54.920 --> 36:57.150
Are you going to turn against me too?

36:57.440 --> 36:58.300
Old Madam Rong!

37:01.510 --> 37:02.370
Old Madam Rong!

37:02.550 --> 37:03.320
Grandmother!

37:03.320 --> 37:04.180
Old Madam Rong!

37:04.440 --> 37:05.300
Old Madam Rong!

37:06.520 --> 37:07.380
Old Madam Rong!

37:20.880 --> 37:21.360
My Lord.

37:22.000 --> 37:23.280
Why isn't Madam Yang's name

37:23.280 --> 37:24.880
inscribed on her tombstone?

37:24.960 --> 37:27.030
The Yang family accused her
of being unfilial and disrespectful.

37:27.030 --> 37:29.030
Outsiders blamed her
for lacking wifely virtue

37:29.030 --> 37:30.690
and refusing to be compliant.

37:31.030 --> 37:32.880
They thought this brought the disaster

37:32.880 --> 37:34.480
to the Wei and Yang families.

37:35.110 --> 37:35.800
Shanbao fears

37:35.800 --> 37:38.320
someone might deliberately damage
the grave

37:38.320 --> 37:39.920
and disturb the peace of the deceased.

37:39.920 --> 37:41.080
If the Wei family had not bullied
Madam Yang

37:41.080 --> 37:42.210
and the Yang family had not brought
false charges,

37:42.210 --> 37:44.070
nothing bad would have occurred.

37:44.190 --> 37:46.120
Those people are truly shameless!

37:50.960 --> 37:51.710
Shanbao.

38:05.480 --> 38:06.190
Shanbao.

38:06.800 --> 38:08.260
When Grandmother learned

38:08.360 --> 38:09.710
that you personally brought the body back

38:09.710 --> 38:10.770
from the Government Office for burial,

38:10.770 --> 38:12.170
she was utterly enraged.

38:12.550 --> 38:13.440
Yunxi

38:13.440 --> 38:15.280
and Xiangling pleaded on your behalf.

38:15.280 --> 38:17.670
They were both severely scolded
by Grandmother.

38:17.670 --> 38:18.670
Grandmother even forbade everyone
in the mansion

38:18.670 --> 38:20.530
from having any contact with you.

38:20.550 --> 38:22.010
Grandmother has also said

38:22.150 --> 38:24.080
that those tea plantations you own

38:24.370 --> 38:25.280
are not allowed to operate

38:25.280 --> 38:26.960
under the Rong family's name.

38:28.150 --> 38:28.840
Shanbao.

38:29.230 --> 38:30.150
You should come back with me

38:30.150 --> 38:31.880
and apologize to Grandmother.

38:32.000 --> 38:33.840
Grandmother loves you
and values you deeply.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.840
She has spared no effort
in nurturing you all these years.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.840
If you're willing to go back
and apologize,

38:37.840 --> 38:38.510
you'll still be

38:38.510 --> 38:40.370
the noble lady of the Rong family.

38:40.630 --> 38:42.190
You won't have to live out here
in the wilderness,

38:42.190 --> 38:43.590
exposed to the elements.

38:44.010 --> 38:46.550
We women of the Rong family
start our education at four.

38:46.550 --> 38:48.120
The very first lesson we learn

38:48.120 --> 38:49.920
is that we don't follow the ruler

38:50.110 --> 38:50.920
or our elders,

38:51.840 --> 38:53.110
but moral conscience

38:53.440 --> 38:54.440
and true justice.

38:55.040 --> 38:57.070
I've said everything
that needs to be said.

38:57.070 --> 38:58.840
It's not that I don't want to be filial.

38:58.840 --> 39:00.630
It's that Grandmother is angry with me

39:00.630 --> 39:02.190
and won't let me go back home.

39:02.190 --> 39:04.000
Yunshu, you're gentle and obedient,

39:04.000 --> 39:06.320
devoting yourself wholeheartedly
to serving Grandmother.

39:06.320 --> 39:09.760
In the days to come, please take care
of Grandmother in my place

39:09.760 --> 39:11.820
and bring comfort and joy to her side.

39:12.070 --> 39:14.330
Lady Shanbao, how could I compare to you?

39:14.630 --> 39:16.230
I am not the legitimate heir.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.770
And my mother was a maid.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.710
I do not acknowledge distinctions of birth

39:19.710 --> 39:21.040
or social hierarchies.

39:22.030 --> 39:24.030
Your parents were a perfect couple.

39:24.440 --> 39:26.280
You are your father's only daughter

39:26.280 --> 39:27.400
and my dear cousin.

39:28.230 --> 39:29.030
However,

39:30.030 --> 39:32.190
Yunshu, you have chosen a difficult path.

39:32.190 --> 39:34.850
Please take good care of yourself
in the future.

39:36.150 --> 39:38.480
Shanbao, what are you talking about?

39:39.800 --> 39:40.710
I mean

39:41.670 --> 39:44.320
it's getting dark
and the mountain path is dangerous.

39:44.320 --> 39:46.190
Yunshu, your eyesight isn't good,

39:46.190 --> 39:48.390
so you must be extra careful
with your steps.

39:48.390 --> 39:50.720
You'd better head down the mountain soon.

39:56.190 --> 39:58.190
Thank you for your concern, Shanbao.

39:58.190 --> 39:59.450
I'll keep that in mind.

39:59.920 --> 40:02.580
Shanbao, please take good care
of yourself too.

40:33.210 --> 40:35.420
[Tomb of Lin Pingxiang,
from the Gu Branch of the Rong Clan]

40:48.110 --> 40:48.880
Xiu Qiong.

40:50.070 --> 40:51.400
Just now, did you notice

40:52.190 --> 40:53.920
how Yunshu reacted when she saw

40:54.070 --> 40:54.930
that new grave?

40:55.710 --> 40:57.070
Lady Yunshu is blind.

40:57.510 --> 40:59.440
What could she possibly have seen?

40:59.670 --> 41:00.670
But Lady Shanbao,

41:01.000 --> 41:02.710
who exactly was this Lin Pingxiang?

41:02.710 --> 41:03.510
Why did you come here specially

41:03.510 --> 41:05.280
to choose an auspicious burial site
for her

41:05.280 --> 41:06.630
and specifically instructed someone

41:06.630 --> 41:09.290
to plant February Orchids
in front of the grave?

41:31.960 --> 41:33.360
Don't worry, Godmother.

41:34.000 --> 41:34.800
From now on,

41:35.920 --> 41:38.320
I will definitely take good care
of Wanwan.

41:39.000 --> 41:39.710
As for the one who has been

41:39.710 --> 41:41.910
stirring up trouble behind the scenes,

41:41.950 --> 41:44.010
I will never let them get away with it.

41:45.760 --> 41:46.560
Young Master.

41:46.710 --> 41:47.840
You've been waiting eagerly for so long.

41:47.840 --> 41:48.800
Are you really leaving
without even meeting

41:48.800 --> 41:49.590
Lady Shanbao?

41:49.590 --> 41:50.550
Her top priority right now

41:50.550 --> 41:51.950
is not personal romance.

41:52.000 --> 41:52.960
It's to bring the real culprit

41:52.960 --> 41:54.510
who killed Madam Yang to justice
as soon as possible.

41:54.510 --> 41:55.710
By my duty and by my feelings,

41:55.710 --> 41:56.630
I can no longer let this person

41:56.630 --> 41:57.560
remain at large.

41:58.440 --> 41:59.840
Didn't she hang herself?

41:59.960 --> 42:01.710
How could there be a real culprit?

42:01.710 --> 42:02.490
Young Master!

42:02.490 --> 42:05.150
[Linji Prefectural Office]

42:03.710 --> 42:04.230
My Lord.

42:04.630 --> 42:06.590
We already gave our answer yesterday.

42:06.590 --> 42:08.070
After Venerable Huijing took her vows,

42:08.070 --> 42:09.530
she became a Buddhist nun.

42:09.960 --> 42:11.620
Apart from Lady Rong Shanbao,

42:11.790 --> 42:13.360
she never received
any other outside visitors.

42:13.360 --> 42:15.190
Please think carefully again

42:15.710 --> 42:18.510
and see if there's anything
you might have missed.

42:23.160 --> 42:23.820
Venerable,

42:24.190 --> 42:25.590
did you notice anything?

42:28.030 --> 42:29.960
Feel free to speak. It's all right.

42:30.590 --> 42:34.400
That day I forgot
about the evening prayers.

42:34.760 --> 42:37.700
I was afraid others would blame me,
so I dared not mention it.

42:37.700 --> 42:40.090
I ran into a male visitor.

42:40.670 --> 42:41.870
What did he look like?

42:42.360 --> 42:44.400
He was tall and thin,

42:44.970 --> 42:45.940
wearing a cloak.

42:46.550 --> 42:47.960
He walked very fast.

42:49.790 --> 42:51.060
Tall and thin?

42:52.350 --> 42:54.230
Yang Yitang! It must be him!

42:54.470 --> 42:56.240
Send men to find Yang Yitang.

42:58.710 --> 42:59.910
[Provincial Governor's Office]

43:01.860 --> 43:02.340
My Lord,

43:02.590 --> 43:05.920
Yang Yitang has entered
the Provincial Governor's Office.

43:12.150 --> 43:12.710
My Lord.

43:13.150 --> 43:14.550
Before, you were the Imperial Inspector,

43:14.550 --> 43:15.840
representing the Emperor
on inspection tours,

43:15.840 --> 43:17.550
so Jiang Yiqian had to show you
some respect.

43:17.550 --> 43:19.220
Now that you're merely a Prefect,

43:19.220 --> 43:20.940
you must be extremely careful
under his roof.
